+/*
+ * Mountrip — travel presentation template, rebuilt with pptxgenjs.
+ *
+ * 33 slides, 13.333 x 7.5 in (16:9).  Everything below is plain pptxgenjs:
+ * a small palette / font / text-style catalogue, a handful of drawing
+ * helpers, one builder function per slide, and a loop that runs them.
+ *
+ * Photographs in the source deck are flat grey placeholder images; they are
+ * reproduced here as grey rectangles via `photo()`.  Raster icons are redrawn
+ * from native shapes and glyphs by `icon()`.
+ *
+ * Run:  node <thisfile>.js   ->  writes <thisfile>.pptx next to the script.
+ */
